OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fblustery showers continue this evening
OL,7,Fand tonight, along with a few clear
OL,8,Fintervals. Strong southwesterly winds,
OL,9,Fwith coastal gales possible for a time
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,13,Fand further showers, most frequent in
OL,14,FArgyll but becoming more scattered in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon as winds continue to
OL,16,Fease down.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
